
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory contains the pointing history, efficiency functions for each
block, and the list of detected objects, separated into various dynamical
classes, for the g-band blocks of CFEPS. The r-band L3h block is in CFEPS_r
and the R-band presurvey block is in CFEPS_presurvey.

The content of this directory is:

CFEPS_g
   \---------- README.cfeps_g (this file) Describes the content of the directory
    \--------- README.formats           Describes format of a survey "block"
     \-------- pointings.list           List of pointings and times of the
      \                                 survey
       \------ LnX-smooth.eff           Efficiency function for block LnX,
        \                               where n gives the year (200n) and X (a
         \                              single letter) gives the fortnight the
          \                             data was acquired
            \- CFEPS_g.detections       List of objects really detected in
	    |                           the CFEPS g-band blocks, with their
            |                           dynamical class if known, magnitude at
            |                           detection, rate of motion, H mag, and
            |                           more.
             \- CFEPS_g.CDS             Same as CFEPS_g.detections, in CDS
                                        format.

Six CFEPS objects (L3s04, L3s05, L4h05PD, L4h13, L4v01, L4v02) were later
re-detected by OSSOS. They also appear in OSSOS_v11 under their OSSOS
designations; the correspondence is in the top-level Duplicates file.
Simulating CFEPS_g and OSSOS_v11 together counts them twice.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
